From 304c2ef7648ab4969fad234347c4cccdc8677f93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 01:56:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Track never-passing wake probe episodes across
 re-parks

Proof: 103 targeted tests pass (31 episode tests); original five acceptance tests on parent 2809ac61c7c yielded 1 pass and 4 failures including cases 1 and 3. Adds durable episode start/count, 48h configurable reconsideration and rate limit, reset boundaries and probe-state readback. Local-only state; cross-gateway carry review remains before publication.
